    skos:prefLabel 'Enrichment with respect to 143Nd/144Nd in the CHondritic Uniform Reservoir (CHUR) of neodymium-143 {143Nd CAS 14336-83-5} {epsilon Nd value} in the atmosphere [aerosol phase] by inductively-coupled plasma mass spectrometry'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The isotope ratio of 143Nd/144Nd in atmospheric aerosol particles expressed using the epsilon notation defined as Epsilon(Nd) = ( ( ([143Nd/144Nd]sample / [143Nd/144Nd]CHUR)-1 ) x 10000 ). One epsilon unit represents a one part per 10,000 deviation from the CHUR composition.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::NDCHAT01'^^xsd:string .
