    skos:definition 'Measurements made by radiotracer and antibiotic doped incubation in the dark followed by counting of particulates collected on a 0.2um pore filter filtering water previously filtered through a 2um pore filter. Rates normalised by dividing total uptake by incubation duration in hours.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::SNPURYPF'^^xsd:string .
