    skos:definition 'Measurements made by radiotracer and antibiotic doped constant light incubation at 188 uE/m2/s followed by counting particulates collected on each filter of a filter cascade down to a 0.2um pore filter. Rates normalised by dividing the total uptake by the incubation duration in hours and total value obtained by summing size-fractionated data.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::NCUPRZP4'^^xsd:string .
